  "steps": [
    "Sauté the onion and garlic in the olive oil until translucent. Add the carrots and celery and cook 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chicken, broth, rosemary, thyme, and sage. Bring to a boil, then cover and simmer on low 10-12 minutes until the chicken reaches 165°F.",
    "Remove the chicken and shred it. Add the orzo and cook about 10 minutes until al dente.",
    "Return the chicken, add the peas, and remove the herb stems. Stir in the lemon juice, season with salt and pepper, and serve topped with parsley."
